{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Corrected the provisional diagnosis before claim or host mutation after inspecting commits 4214516f95 and 31844d5f9f. The committed Click override and lock are correct and must be consumed, not weakened. The actual updater defect is its unlocked pipx VCS install, which bypasses the workspace-only override and requests the declared-incompatible eval+dev pair. Revised plan: exact-SHA versioned checkout, uv sync --locked with runtime/operator extras and --no-dev, locked Click/pip-audit proof, atomic publication, and launchd verification."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785808124289317001,"uuid":"5b13eece-8826-4a63-b9b7-af1ec71f6056"}